        "rationale": "The adapter's only success path that mints claims. Two splits of 4 and 2 move 6 atoms of cash into the hoard and credit 6 internal claims of every outcome; the supply ledger's two terms and the kernel aggregate stay equal at every step, which is the closure re-checked after the transition as well as before it. Step 2 replays sequence 1 after it was consumed, and the replay refusal precedes every state write, so the post-state is the one step 1 left.",
